---
---
<section class="tags-section" id="tags">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">TAGS &amp; SNS</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">タグについて</h2>

    <div class="tag-cards">
      <div class="tag-card tag-card--primary">
        <div class="tag-label-row">
          <span class="tag-type">正式タグ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="big-tag">#ゴールデンBesiegeタイム</div>
        <p>この企画の正式名であり、日本語での告知・投稿に使うタグです。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tag-card tag-card--en">
        <div class="tag-label-row">
          <span class="tag-type">英語圏向けタグ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="big-tag">#FridayBesiege</div>
        <p>英語圏向けの併記タグとして使います。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="tag-note">可能であれば、<strong>両方付けて</strong>投稿してください。</p>

    <h3 class="sub-heading">各SNSでの参加方法</h3>

    <div class="sns-grid">
      <div class="sns-card">
        <div class="sns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- 公式アイコン: discord.com/branding より取得 -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 127.8 96" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M81.15,0c-1.2376,2.1973-2.3489,4.4704-3.3591,6.794-9.5975-1.4396-19.3718-1.4396-28.9945,0-.985-2.3236-2.1216-4.5967-3.3591-6.794-9.0166,1.5407-17.8059,4.2431-26.1405,8.0568C2.779,32.5304-1.6914,56.3725.5312,79.8863c9.6732,7.1476,20.5083,12.603,32.0505,16.0884,2.6014-3.4854,4.8998-7.1981,6.8698-11.0623-3.738-1.3891-7.3497-3.1318-10.8098-5.1523.9092-.6567,1.7932-1.3386,2.6519-1.9953,20.281,9.547,43.7696,9.547,64.0758,0,.8587.7072,1.7427,1.3891,2.6519,1.9953-3.4601,2.0457-7.0718,3.7632-10.835,5.1776,1.97,3.8642,4.2683,7.5769,6.8698,11.0623,11.5419-3.4854,22.3769-8.9156,32.0509-16.0631,2.626-27.2771-4.496-50.9172-18.817-71.8548C98.9811,4.2684,90.1918,1.5659,81.1752.0505l-.0252-.0505ZM42.2802,65.4144c-6.2383,0-11.4159-5.6575-11.4159-12.6535s4.9755-12.6788,11.3907-12.6788,11.5169,5.708,11.4159,12.6788c-.101,6.9708-5.026,12.6535-11.3907,12.6535ZM84.3576,65.4144c-6.2637,0-11.3907-5.6575-11.3907-12.6535s4.9755-12.6788,11.3907-12.6788,11.4917,5.708,11.3906,12.6788c-.101,6.9708-5.026,12.6535-11.3906,12.6535Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Discord</h4>
        <p>Besiegeサーバー内でスクリーンショットを投稿するときは、出来ればハッシュタグを添えてください。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sns-card">
        <div class="sns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Twitter(X)</h4>
        <p>ハッシュタグ付きでスクリーンショットや動画を投稿してください。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sns-card">
        <div class="sns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>YouTube</h4>
        <p>ハッシュタグを付けるか、概要欄や動画内で言及して投稿してください。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sns-card">
        <div class="sns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/FridayBesiegeWeb/icons/niconico.png" alt="ニコニコ動画" class="sns-icon-img" />
        </div>
        <h4>ニコニコ動画</h4>
        <p>概要欄や動画内などで言及して投稿してください。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.tags-section {
  padding: 5rem 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
}

.section-heading {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
  color: var(--color-cream);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.tag-cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.tag-card {
  padding: 2rem;
  background: var(--color-bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-light);
}

.tag-card--primary {
  border-top: 4px solid var(--color-orange);
}

.tag-card--en {
  border-top: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
}

.tag-label-row { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }

.tag-type {
  font-family: var(--font-display-mixed);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.big-tag {
  font-family: var(--font-display-mixed);
  font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.tag-card--primary .big-tag { color: var(--color-orange); }
.tag-card--en     .big-tag { color: var(--color-gold); }

.tag-card p {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.tag-note {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--color-text);
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  border: 1px dashed var(--color-stone-light);
  background: rgba(255,107,0,0.04);
}

.tag-note strong { color: var(--color-orange-light); }

.sub-heading {
  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem);
  color: var(--color-cream);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.sns-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.2rem;
}

.sns-card {
  background: var(--color-bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
}

.sns-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-orange);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.sns-icon {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  color: var(--color-orange);
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  opacity: 0.8;
}

.sns-icon-img {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  object-fit: contain;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.sns-card h4 {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--color-cream);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.sns-card p {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.sns-card p strong { color: var(--color-orange-light); }
</style>
